    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. the fungal thing makes sense but it's weird how fast it happens. i did a check this morning and i actually saw some tiny little things moving around near the base of the stems, almost like they were hiding under the leaves so i couldn't see them clearly. could it be something else besides fungi? like some kind of insect that comes out mostly at night or hides in the shadows?",
